  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43341058",
      "title": "Configuring Static Page Metadata",
      "lectureOrder": 202,
      "videoOrder": 188,
      "sourceHash": "62c63967b07495fdfecb0c872a11229315c0018ddb08d654369ba6fa62df7a7b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.61,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmüller] So how can you add metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.61,
          "end": 4.56,
          "en": "to NextJS pages?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.56,
          "end": 8.97,
          "en": "Well, the most straightforward way of adding metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.97,
          "end": 12.39,
          "en": "is to go to a page where you want to add it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.39,
          "end": 16.54,
          "en": "and typically, you should add metadata to all your pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.64,
          "end": 21.18,
          "en": "and then in that page.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.18,
          "end": 25.5,
          "en": "you export a constant called metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.5,
          "end": 27.84,
          "en": "and it must be called metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.84,
          "end": 32.55,
          "en": "and it must be in a page.js file or a layout.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.55,
          "end": 36.003,
          "en": "as you will see soon, and it must be exported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.47,
          "end": 41.94,
          "en": "Now this metadata constant then should hold an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 41.94,
          "end": 45.96,
          "en": "and that object can hold a couple of different properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45.96,
          "end": 47.85,
          "en": "that you can configure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.85,
          "end": 51,
          "en": "Most importantly, you can set a title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51,
          "end": 53.583,
          "en": "and a description property here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.72,
          "end": 58.92,
          "en": "And the title property will determine the page title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 58.92,
          "end": 63.92,
          "en": "which for example, also will show up here in your tabs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 64.2,
          "end": 66,
          "en": "but which will also show up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 66,
          "end": 68.94,
          "en": "when your page is displayed as a search result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 68.94,
          "end": 70.86,
          "en": "on Google, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 70.86,
          "end": 74.25,
          "en": "So here for this page where I display my latest posts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 74.25,
          "end": 78.39,
          "en": "the title could, for example, be latest posts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 78.39,
          "end": 81.36,
          "en": "The description then is some metadata text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 81.36,
          "end": 84.45,
          "en": "which for example, shows up here below the title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.45,
          "end": 89.07,
          "en": "when your page is displayed in search results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 89.07,
          "end": 92.583,
          "en": "So here we could say, browse our latest posts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 93.63,
          "end": 96.06,
          "en": "With that, if you then save that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 96.06,
          "end": 99.09,
          "en": "and you load the page where you added the metadata,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 99.09,
          "end": 101.28,
          "en": "in my case, the starting page here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 101.28,
          "end": 104.58,
          "en": "you'll see that the title is indeed reflected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 104.58,
          "end": 108.9,
          "en": "here in the tab and you can also see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 108.9,
          "end": 112.44,
          "en": "that metadata text you added that description text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 112.44,
          "end": 116.67,
          "en": "if you go to the head tag of the loaded page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 116.67,
          "end": 120.9,
          "en": "And then there you should see that description meta element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 120.9,
          "end": 123.06,
          "en": "which contains that description text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 123.06,
          "end": 125.13,
          "en": "and that's the text that, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 125.13,
          "end": 127.053,
          "en": "would show up in search results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 127.95,
          "end": 131.55,
          "en": "Now, you can also add more fields than just title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 131.55,
          "end": 135.27,
          "en": "and description to this exported metadata object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 135.27,
          "end": 139.07999999999998,
          "en": "and your official metadata fields reference page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 139.07999999999998,
          "end": 140.85,
          "en": "holds all the details about that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 140.85,
          "end": 143.07,
          "en": "and shows you all the different values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 143.07,
          "end": 144.36,
          "en": "and fields you can add here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 144.36,
          "end": 147.153,
          "en": "and attached you find a link to that document.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 148.32,
          "end": 151.26,
          "en": "You can, for example, also add a open graph setting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 151.26,
          "end": 154.59,
          "en": "to this metadata object, which controls the metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.59,
          "end": 159.51,
          "en": "that will be used when you share a page on X or Facebook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 159.51,
          "end": 162.36,
          "en": "So for example, you can control which image will be shown",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 162.36,
          "end": 167.07,
          "en": "as a preview if you share a link to your page and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 167.07,
          "end": 169.8,
          "en": "So these are all settings you can set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 169.8,
          "end": 171.72,
          "en": "on that metadata object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 171.72,
          "end": 175.473,
          "en": "which is exported with that metadata constant.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
